	XTEST

-------------------------------------------------------------------------
Note of Credit...

Evans & Sutherland and I would like to thank the XFree Project Inc. for 
their excellent work. Without the XFree Project, this product would not
have been possible. The source tree has been one of easiest development
trees I've worked with. I would like to thank all of the people in the
Linux community for providing an excellent development platform. I've
used Linux for several years and I've enjoyed every minute.  

It has been a joy!

Thanks, 

Warren Stout

