I'm announcing a Tcl/Tk shell for skim.
Skim is a package for offline news reading over a slow line.

Skim.tcl is a user friendly front end to skim.

I uploaded skim.tcl to sunsite.unc.edu /pub/Linux/Incomming.
I expected it to go where skim-0.1.tgz lies.

You need: skim-0.1.tgz
	  Tcl/Tk with TclX Extensions.

If you have any questions email me, because skim.tcl
has no connection with the original author of skim-0.1.

Enjoy!

